Port WHOI Cable's GUI movie export (gui/pixbuf2mpeg.c) to the current FFmpeg
encoding API. The original used avcodec_encode_video(), avcodec_alloc_frame(),
CODEC_ID_* and PIX_FMT_* names, all removed from FFmpeg. Output is unchanged:
raw MPEG-1 video at 24 frames per second. Used by scripts/build_gui.sh.

